WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.835
Everyone was learning how to park.

2
00:00:07.836 --> 00:00:11.236
"Watch me," said Ms. Fender.

3
00:00:11.237 --> 00:00:13.873
The teacher drove backward.

4
00:00:13.874 --> 00:00:19.676
She turned her wheels.

5
00:00:19.677 --> 00:00:24.416
She parked next to a curb.

6
00:00:24.417 --> 00:00:30.012
"Everybody, practice," said Ms. Fender.

7
00:00:30.013 --> 00:00:34.924
"We have a test this afternoon."

8
00:00:34.925 --> 00:00:38.358
Eddy gulped.

9
00:00:38.359 --> 00:00:43.319
"I don't like tests," he thought.

10
00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:45.585
Poppy tried to park.

11
00:00:45.586 --> 00:00:47.764
Her wheel hit the curb.

12
00:00:47.765 --> 00:00:50.221
"Oops!" she said.

13
00:00:50.222 --> 00:00:53.784
"I turned too much!"

14
00:00:53.785 --> 00:00:56.409
She tried again.

15
00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:59.027
"Oops!" she said.

16
00:00:59.028 --> 00:01:04.438
"I didn't turn enough!"

17
00:01:04.439 --> 00:01:07.047
Eddy backed up.

18
00:01:07.048 --> 00:01:08.907
He turned.

19
00:01:08.908 --> 00:01:12.107
He parked next to the curb.

20
00:01:12.108 --> 00:01:15.849
"Perfect, Eddy," said Ms. Fender.

21
00:01:15.850 --> 00:01:18.770
"Wow!" said Jeb.

22
00:01:18.771 --> 00:01:22.719
"Eddy doesn't need to practice!"

23
00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:26.471
Zippy laughed.

24
00:01:26.472 --> 00:01:29.349
"Parking is slow," he said.

25
00:01:29.350 --> 00:01:32.727
"That's why Eddy can do it!"

26
00:01:32.728 --> 00:01:55.146
"Grr!" said Eddy.

